    "headline": "High Wind Warning issued October 17 at 11:53AM PDT until October 17 at 8:00PM PDT by NWS San Diego CA",
    "description": "* WHAT...Easterly winds 15 to 20 mph with gusts 35 to 45 mph.\nStrongest below the San Gorgonio Pass.\n\n* WHERE...San Bernardino and Riverside County Valleys-The Inland\nEmpire.\n\n* WHEN...Until 8 PM PDT this evening.\n\n* IMPACTS...Damaging winds could blow down trees and power lines.\nPower outages are possible. Travel could be difficult for high\nprofile vehicles.",
